{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22473","headline":"步东坡 · 白居易","name":"步东坡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝上东坡步，夕上东坡步。\n东坡何所爱，爱此新成树。\n种植当岁初，滋荣及春暮。\n信意取次栽，无行亦无数。\n绿阴斜景转，芳气微风度。\n新叶鸟下来，萎花蝶飞去。\n闲携斑竹杖，徐曳黄麻屦。\n欲识往来频，青芜成白路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}